  "description": "The pivot engine of ExPivot: a Snapshot's columns aggregated under a serialisable Pivot Layout into a Pivot Report, with Excel's PivotTable semantics — Items, Hidden Items, Sum to Varp with money summed exactly, subtotals, grand totals, the three report forms and Show Values As — and the bundled Pivot Source, which folds live Change Batches in. No UI: a server computes the same report the screen shows.",
